<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-e33019af-d764-8a85-5560-3c0215629038" style="font-size: 15.4545450210571px; line-height: 15.6818180084229px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font face="Georgia"><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Good afternoon {!Contact.FirstName},</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Thank you for registering for tonight’s information session. &nbsp;This session will be covering the EdD in leadership and innovation program details and admissions information, and faculty will be available to help answer your questions as well.&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">This is an in-person information session, and takes place today, [<b>Tuesday, September 16th, from 5:30pm-7:30pm in room 000 located in the AAA Building</b>].&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">I look forward to having you join the session. &nbsp;If you have any questions or concerns please feel free to contact me!</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Kindest regards,</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Amy Hettmansperger, M. Ed</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Student Outreach Coordinator, Sr.</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font color="#990000"><b>Arizona State University</b></font> | <font color="#ffcc33"><b>Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College</b></font></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">amy.hettmansperger@asu.edu &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">480-965-9789</p></font></span>]]></td>
